  "description": "Convert gas fired heating system to low carbon heating by installing a 12kw air source heatpump (Vaillant aerotherm plus) in location hidden from public view on paved area to rear of house and adjoining nature area.\n\nConnect heat pump through existing air bricks into existing cellar to new hot water cylinder (Vaillant uniSTOR 200L).\n\nConnect cylinder and controls to existing heating and hot water pipework in cellar. \n\nRemove existing gas boiler and hot water tank and upgrade 4 existing radiators to low temperature models (type 22 - 600 x 1200 mm).\n\n"
